{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A haunting journey through distorted reality, lost memories, and buried truths.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re stuck in an endless loop inside a mysterious mansion plagued by <strong>anomalies</strong>. Your job? <strong>Report them to the Complaints Office.</strong> But something isn\u2019t right. Every hallway holds secrets, every detail might be wrong \u2014 and the deeper you go, the more the house starts revealing <strong>its curse\u2026 and your past</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just about spotting what\u2019s off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s about <strong>uncovering why</strong> you\u2019re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And who you really are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why is this mansion cursed?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happened to you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And how do you break the loop?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 A tense third-person anomaly-spotting loop experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Psychological gameplay focused on observation and memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Explore a cursed mansion to uncover its dark history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Subtle and disturbing visual/environmental anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Piece together a fragmented story to discover your true identity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you break the curse\u2026 or will you become part of it?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716140?t=17474